<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">27062026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>An Iranian drone struck the cargo ship Ever Lovely as it crossed the Strait of Hormuz, and United States forces intercepted three others before striking Iranian missile sites and coastal radar.</s>
<s>It's the first American strike since a peace memorandum that Washington now accuses Tehran of violating.</s>
<s>Iran says vessels that skip its designated corridors can't be guaranteed safe passage... and both sides have sixty days to negotiate before the interim deal collapses.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Hezbollah says it will keep its weapons even after Lebanon, Israel, and the United States signed a peace framework in Washington.</s>
<s>The deal carves out an Israeli security zone in southern Lebanon and demands Hezbollah disarm, the exact condition on which every prior truce has foundered.</s>
<s>Lebanon's president hailed the agreement, but its survival now hinges on a full Israeli withdrawal that hasn't yet come.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Burkina Faso's junta has cut all diplomatic ties with France, accusing Paris of backing jihadist networks in the Sahel.</s>
<s>It completes a regional sweep, after Mali severed relations in twenty twenty-two and Niger in twenty twenty-three, each junta pivoting from Paris toward Moscow.</s>
<s>What fills the security vacuum left behind is the question now haunting the whole Sahel.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistani drones killed nine members of a single Afghan family in Khost province.</s>
<s>The United Nations mission in Afghanistan had already verified three hundred seventy-two civilian deaths from Pakistan's operations before this strike, which killed mostly women and children.</s>
<s>Islamabad is brokering peace abroad even as its strikes deepen a quieter war on its own border.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The European Union has moved to strip refuge from newly arriving Ukrainian men of military age.</s>
<s>Kyiv itself requested the carve-out to address manpower shortages, while Brussels proposed extending protection for everyone else until March twenty twenty-eight.</s>
<s>Europe's own rights watchdog has warned the plan may breach the protections it was built to uphold.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>India's Prime Minister Modi opened a summit in Seychelles, arriving with two navy ships and seven new cooperation agreements.</s>
<s>It revives India's MAHASAGAR doctrine, which casts Delhi as the resident security provider across an Indian Ocean that China is also courting.</s>
<s>A hundred-thousand-person archipelago has become the leverage point in a contest over the world's busiest sea lanes.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Colombia's next president has pledged fracking to the max, vowing to reverse the country's role as a climate leader.</s>
<s>Under Petro, Colombia became the first major oil producer to ban new fossil-fuel expansion and sign a non-proliferation treaty at the Dubai climate summit.</s>
<s>One mid-sized petrostate's turn now tests whether leave it in the ground can ever hold as state policy.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The German space firm OHB has raised four hundred eighty-two million euros to expand its launch capacity.</s>
<s>The share issue, sold at a steep twenty-six percent discount, bankrolls satellite manufacturing and Rocket Factory Augsburg, Germany's bid for independent European access to orbit.</s>
<s>Europe's legacy space industry is recapitalizing fast as American private rockets pull further ahead.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Brussels faces one hundred percent American tariffs if it taxes the revenues of United States tech companies.</s>
<s>Digital services taxes are designed to capture the profits those firms book offshore, and President Trump says any country imposing one will see its trade deals superseded overnight.</s>
<s>It turns a question of tax fairness into a test of who really sets the terms of global commerce.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>France recorded its all-time hottest day twice in a row as record June heat gripped western Europe.</s>
<s>A rapid attribution study found such temperatures were virtually impossible fifty years ago, and overnight extremes are now a hundred times likelier than in two thousand three.</s>
<s>Seventy-two of France's ninety-six departments fell under red alert, and each new record narrows the gap between extreme and normal.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>NASA has delivered the braking engines for Europe's twice-stranded Rosalind Franklin Mars rover.</s>
<s>Russia's withdrawal in twenty twenty-two scrapped the rover's landing platform, and the United States stepped in with engines, launch services, and radioisotope heaters to keep electronics warm in the Martian cold.</s>
<s>A mission built to drill two metres in search of past life has survived by re-sourcing its hardware around geopolitics.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Madrid, scans first led doctors to diagnose a man with brain cancer, until an MRI revealed tapeworm larvae instead.</s>
<s>The patient had never travelled abroad, but his construction coworkers came from regions where Taenia solium is endemic.</s>
<s>Cysticercosis causes more epilepsy than any other single infection, and he recovered fully on antiparasitic drugs.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers at Oxford have found that rock erosion can release carbon dioxide and amplify global warming.</s>
<s>As ancient organic carbon locked in sediment is exposed and oxidizes, the warming that drives erosion intensifies the very release that feeds it.</s>
<s>The team estimates the feedback shrinks the world's remaining carbon budget over the coming centuries.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>South Korea plans to arm all four hundred fifty thousand of its troops with drones.</s>
<s>Facing a North Korean army of one-point-two million, Seoul is turning to the asymmetric lesson Ukraine taught, starting with eleven thousand training drones this year.</s>
<s>Drone fluency is shifting from a specialist skill to a baseline of infantry warfare, and the economics of attrition with it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Gene-edited pig kidneys have markedly prolonged the survival of primate recipients.</s>
<s>Scientists knocked out three pig carbohydrate antigens that trigger human rejection, then added human regulatory genes, because immune rejection, not surgery, is the wall xenotransplants hit.</s>
<s>Sustained survival over months is the threshold a human trial would need, and this brings it closer.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Taiwan is building chip and electric-vehicle factories in Poland.</s>
<s>Warsaw chose Taipei to replace Chinese and American investors in key industrial projects, handing Taiwan a diplomatic foothold inside NATO.</s>
<s>It gives the island a manufacturing base in Europe just as Beijing works to isolate it.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>